  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Send a link, not an attachment.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Every Record has a link you can send to anyone: a client, an insurer, a landlord. They do not need an account or a password.</p>
  <p class="site-words">The link opens the Record as a web page. It stays open for a year from the day it is made.</p>
  <p class="site-words">The link shows the Record. It leaves out the private conversation behind it, so what you share is the report and nothing else.</p>
  <p class="site-words">You read and sign the report yourself first. The link is for sending it on when you are happy with it.</p>
